  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nHowever, tests in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/35be3b44f3111c4d614b5b201e399493d20e7b38#diff-03d35d7fd798b2fd1708a1ef5e299e4da01b6788a614a5ff21918067165c2733 contradict this as they assume `open()` can be called on these documents (`open()` would throw if the document had an opaque origin).\n\nI think WebKit currently complies with the specification, but we could change this. Not sure if we had a strong reason for the status quo?",
